s and legs, and we're ready to get back out there! We also have some important news to share... We’re officially rebranding our game to “Kissing Things With Your Friends”! After a lot of discussion and careful consideration, we decided t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:13:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691643","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3675340-1845383656383350","game_id":"steam-3675340","kind":"announcement","title":"Killing Things With The Devs at PAX Aus","summary":"EXOGEN LABS - SUBJECT ADVISORYThe dev team's headed to PAX Australia! Bags are packed, arms are attached, mutants are left at home - come play our game and say hello!-- FlightlessHowdy Test Subjects!September's a huge month for gaming this year, and that's no different for us!Unlike other studios, we're not launching this month to avoid 2026's biggest mutant yet - you know the one - but we're still cooking up some chaos for you to get your hands on, and our brand new demo is coming to PAX Austra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T17:56:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383350","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3675340-1844115010495354","game_id":"steam-3675340","kind":"announcement","title":"All New Exogen","summary":"EXOGEN LABS - SUBJECT ADVISORYTesting facilities face advancement. Lethal mutations and testing equipment receive integration, and test subjects protest scrub juice flavour...-- Exogen Trial OperationsHello Test Subjects!It’s been a little while since we last put out an update, but the team has been working hard in the labs, cooking up some important changes, features and content that will round out the experience of Killing Things With Your Friends. Take a look below at what we’ve been building","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T16:17:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3675340-1835236783575031","game_id":"steam-3675340","kind":"announcement","title":"A Change of Plan","summary":"EXOGEN LABS - SUBJECT ADVISORYAdvanced testing programs face reconstruction. With new researchers comes new soundwaves, and the Exogen surgical team's latest creation...-- Exogen Trial OperationsHello Test Subjects!We've emerged from Exogen's labs to bring you an important update on our plans for Killing Things With Your Friends and its Next Fest demo.Time To BakeAn opportunity recently came our way that was too good not to take, and as a result we have made the hard decision to cancel our demo ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T17:03:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783575031","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3675340-1832700592795761","game_id":"steam-3675340","kind":"announcement","title":"Killing Things With Your Friends at Next Fest!","summary":"EXOGEN LABS - SUBJECT ADVISORYAdvanced testing programs are initializing. New trial modules have completed construction, and trial participants are facing reassembly for Next Fest.-- Exogen Trial OperationsHello Test Subjects!We’ve been working hard on getting new content and updates into the game in preparation for our next playtest, so here’s a quick look into what we’ve been cooking up in our lab…Killing Things at Next Fest!Killing Things With Your Friends is coming to June Next Fest from Jun","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-17T10:06:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592795761","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3675340-1830163047263691","game_id":"steam-3675340","kind":"update","title":"Post-Playtest Update","summary":"EXOGEN LABS - SUBJECT ADVISORYFeedback has been analysed and applied to the testing program. Trial modules have undergone reconfiguration and mopping, and new comm-links have been distributed to participants.-- Exogen Trial OperationsHello Test Subjects,Now that we've finished our first open playtest, we want to share with you an update on what we’ve learned and what’s coming next for Killing Things With Your Friends.Playtest FeedbackThank you to everyone who jumped into the playtest! We had ove","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-19T08:50:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047263691","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3675340-1828441623103812","game_id":"steam-3675340","kind":"announcement","title":"Configure Your Body","summary":"EXOGEN LABS - SUBJECT ADVISORYThe testing program has undergone several more adjustments. Construction of new labs has been executed, and new modifications have been injected into mutant specimens.Subjects experiencing unexpected exposure to grinders are encouraged to survey their peers for remediation.-- Exogen Trial Operations Hello Test Subjects,As we dive into our first open playtest, we want to share with you the most recent update, bringing new abilities and systems which are key to progre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-27T08:24:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623103812","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3675340-1826992588602321","game_id":"steam-3675340","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the Exploder","summary":"EXOGEN LABS - SUBJECT ADVISORYThe testing program has recently undergone several adjustments. Monitoring systems have been recalibrated, and a new specimen has been deployed within the facility.Subjects experiencing unexpected limb detachment are encouraged to utilise approved biological replacements.-- Exogen Trial OperationsHello Test Subjects,The start of this year has been super busy and we’ve been making some great progress lately that we wanted to share! We'd also like to say thank you and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-16T19:37:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588602321","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3675340-1819386365102162","game_id":"steam-3675340","kind":"announcement","title":"Killing Things With Your Friends","summary":"Hey everyone!2025 is almost over, and it's been a pretty crazy year. We've been keeping mostly quiet until now, but that's all about to change. We're going to be bringing Killing Things With Your Friends to you in 2026, and we can't wait to show you what we've been working on.The first question we often get asked is: How did you come up with the name?We've released a few titles in the past, and before we started development on what is now KTWYF, the five of us were having a chat about what games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-22T15:06:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announc